<view class="page"><view class="card"><text class="title">绑定已登记档案</text><text class="muted">授权手机号后，系统只在唯一匹配时自动绑定；未匹配或重复档案将进入人工审核。</text><button class="primary" open-type="getPhoneNumber" bindgetphonenumber="bindPhone" loading="{{busy}}">授权手机号并绑定</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="register">无法授权，提交人工审核</button><text wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</text></view></view>
